{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554000/extras/description_line_A.png?t=1742029909\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>About this game</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to be a spiderbot, crawling around on ceilings and in mineshafts, drilling away to find an exit and causing blocks to fall and squish your enemies (and occasionally yourself if you are not careful?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Off course you do. So here is the game for that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig your way to victory! Upgrade your bot (perhaps with more legs or a bigger drill). Squish your enemies, and crawl away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Comes with :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mayhem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling blocks that make things go 'splat'</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crawling and creeping of all sorts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554000/extras/description_line_B.png?t=1742029909\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>A word from the developer</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for taking the time to look at this game and/or playing it. I appreciate you and hope you have fun playing this thing that leaked out of my brain space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Martijn Folmer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554000?t=1742029909","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554000?t=1742029909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554000/e4ca0d59716070b981b01bac68203b7920592b11